# Divergence without the repaint. Every charting platform draws
# divergence through pivots, and most of them draw it through pivots
# that were not confirmed yet when the signal supposedly fired. Here a
# pivot is a strict fractal extreme that does not exist until its wing
# closes, so the comparison happens exactly when both pivots are real
# knowledge and never earlier. The bearish twin works as an exit, which
# is where divergence rules most often die silently in hand rolled
# engines — run the backtest and read the rule activity table.

strategy "Divergence Reversal"

universe $SPY
timeframe 1d

when [bullish_divergence rsi 2] and price above [sma 200]
  buy [risk 1%]

sell when [bearish_divergence rsi 2]
  or [stop 4%]
  or [after 30 bars]
